Package: com.551.replacedscreenbattery
Name: Replaced Screen & Battery
Version: 1.0.14
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Hides replaced screen/battery warnings and Settings badges, with added iOS 18 Parts & Service History support.
 Keeps the existing iOS 15-16 behaviour and adds iOS 18 hooks to remove the
 entire Parts & Service History section in General > About, including its gap.
 Includes a master switch and Respring button. iOS 18.5 device testing needed.
Maintainer: 551
Author: 551
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0), mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader
